@startuml Create Reservation Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ReservationController
participant ReservationService
participant SeatRepository
participant ReservationRepository
database DB

User -> UI: Select screening and seats
User -> UI: Confirm reservation

UI -> ReservationController: POST /reservations\nCreateReservationRequest
activate ReservationController

ReservationController -> ReservationService: create(request)
activate ReservationService

ReservationService -> SeatRepository: findUnavailableSeatIds(\nscreeningId, seatIds, activeSince)
activate SeatRepository

SeatRepository -> DB: SELECT unavailable seat IDs
DB --> SeatRepository: List<Long>

SeatRepository --> ReservationService: unavailableSeatIds
deactivate SeatRepository

alt Some seats are unavailable
    ReservationService --> ReservationController: SeatNotAvailableException
    ReservationController --> UI: 409 Conflict
    UI --> User: Display unavailable seats

else All seats are available

    ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: deleteExpiredPending(\nscreeningId, seatIds, activeSince)
    activate ReservationRepository

    ReservationRepository -> DB: DELETE expired PENDING reservations
    DB --> ReservationRepository: deleted rows count

    ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: deletedCount
    deactivate ReservationRepository

    ReservationService -> ReservationService: Create Reservation entity\nstate = PENDING\nexpiresAt = now + 5 min

    ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: save(reservation)
    activate ReservationRepository

    ReservationRepository -> DB: INSERT reservation
    DB --> ReservationRepository: generated ID / persisted row

    ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: saved Reservation
    deactivate ReservationRepository

    ReservationService -> ReservationService: Map Reservation -> ReservationDto

    ReservationService --> ReservationController: ReservationDto

    ReservationController --> UI: 201 Created\nReservationDto
    UI --> User: Display reservation\nand expiration time

end

deactivate ReservationService
deactivate ReservationController

@enduml